law.text:
		The following laws and regulations of the Commonwealth shall not apply to any ridesharing arrangement using a motor vehicle with a seating capacity for not more than fifteen persons, including the driver:

Laws and regulations containing insurance requirements that are specifically applicable to motor carriers or commercial vehicles;


Laws imposing a greater standard of care on motor carriers or commercial vehicles than that imposed on other drivers or owners of motor vehicles;


Laws and regulations with equipment requirements and special accident reporting requirements that are specifically applicable to motor carriers or commercial vehicles; and


Laws imposing a tax on fuel purchased in another state by a motor carrier or road user taxes on commercial buses.
